 # Load Balancer — Retry Logic

### What this branch adds
- Retries another backend server if one fails
- Keeps round-robin routing
- Prevents user-facing downtime

### How it works
1. Select server
2. If unhealthy → try next
3. Continue until success or no servers left

### Run
node loadBalancer.js
